### Global binding example

Source: https://github.com/nestjs/throttler/blob/master/_autodocs/api-reference/ThrottlerGuard.md

Shows how to bind ThrottlerGuard globally using APP_GUARD provider in a NestJS module. Configures ThrottlerModule with a single throttler (ttl: 60000, limit: 10).

```typescript
import { Module } from '@nestjs/common';
import { APP_GUARD } from '@nestjs/core';
import { ThrottlerGuard, ThrottlerModule } from '@nestjs/throttler';

@Module({
  imports: [ThrottlerModule.forRoot([{ ttl: 60000, limit: 10 }])],
  providers: [{ provide: APP_GUARD, useClass: ThrottlerGuard }],
})
export class AppModule {}
```

--------------------------------

### Bind ThrottlerGuard globally with APP_GUARD

Source: https://github.com/nestjs/throttler/blob/master/README.md

Provides ThrottlerGuard as a global guard using the APP_GUARD provider. This applies throttling to all routes by default.

```typescript
{
  provide: APP_GUARD,
  useClass: ThrottlerGuard
}
```

--------------------------------

### Usage Examples

Source: https://github.com/nestjs/throttler/blob/master/_autodocs/api-reference/ThrottlerGuard.md

Examples of global binding and per-route binding with skipping and custom throttle limits.

