### Configure ThrottlerModule with forRoot

Source: https://github.com/nestjs/throttler/blob/master/README.md

Imports ThrottlerModule and sets global options for ttl (time to live in milliseconds) and limit (maximum requests within ttl) for all guarded routes.

```typescript
@Module({
  imports: [
    ThrottlerModule.forRoot([{
      ttl: 60000,
      limit: 10,
    }]),
  ],
})
export class AppModule {}
```

