### Defaults summary

Source: https://github.com/nestjs/throttler/blob/master/_autodocs/configuration.md

## Defaults summary

| Item | Default |
|------|---------|
| Throttler `name` | `"default"` |
| `blockDuration` | `ttl` |
| `setHeaders` | `true` |
| `ipv6SubnetPrefix` | `64` |
| `storage` | `new ThrottlerStorageService()` (in-memory) |
| 429 message | `'ThrottlerException: Too Many Requests'` |
| `@SkipThrottle()` argument | `{ default: true }` |
| `forRoot()` argument | `[]` (no throttlers; guard limits nothing) |
| `ThrottlerStorageService` sweep interval | `60_000` ms |
